<!--
  OmniBridge icon set: 24dp grid, 2px stroke, round caps and joins.

  A device whose kind nobody has stated. Drawn deliberately unlike the
  desktop, phone and tablet glyphs: a peer that has not said what it runs
  must not be pictured as a monitor, because a picture is a claim.
-->
